<!--
  Default strings. The product speaks Chinese on both ends, so the default locale is Chinese too:
  leaving English here meant a zh device that missed values-zh showed a different app.
  values-zh and values-zh-rCN must carry the same keys with the same meaning.

  Copy rules: plain Chinese, active voice, name things by what the user controls
  ("配对码", "已接收文件", "发送到这台电脑") - not by how the code implements them.
-->
